+## Gotchas
+- `via_run.py` matching of sibling findings to ledger entries is a heuristic (issue text, then order, then nearest line within 25 lines). A new finding near a rejected one that has left the run can take its ID. Accepted on purpose.
+- `merge` writes the ledger before `findings.json` on purpose; `pass` must run after `merge`.
+- Run Python with `-B` in this repo. A stray `__pycache__` changes the review gate's tree hash.
+- The Compose sample needs `ANDROID_HOME=$HOME/Library/Android/sdk`. Do not put it in `local.properties` in git.
+- `transitionJiraIssue` takes `transitionName` ("In Progress", "Done"). Jira search results are huge: filter the saved file with `jq`.
+- Branch names are `cesar/NFX-<n>`; the review gate blocks any other. READMEs, docs and PR bodies are in Cesar's first-person voice.
+- Personal paths and keys never go in the repo. Do not run `install.sh` until NFX-24 (known drift, see NFX-1 notes).
